  "notes": [
    {
      "id": 61,
      "at": [
        -80,
        -52
      ],
      "text": "A 16x2 character LCD (HD44780) behind a PCF8574 I2C expander at 0x27, wired like the common I2C LCD\nbackpacks: P0 RS, P1 RW, P2 E, P4-P7 D4-D7 (4-bit mode). The Blue Pill's I2C1 (PB6, PB7) with 4.7 kOhm\npull-ups talks to the PCF8574; the module runs on 5 V. Run (F5): the text appears on the LCD, and the\nsecond row counts seconds. Change rows and columns in the LCD's properties for other modules."
    }
  ]
